cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "OMDRC: Sequential Anomaly Detection with Online Missed Discovery Rate Control"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of OMDRC, an online decision rule that screens a data
  stream one observation at a time while controlling the missed discovery rate
  (MDR) at every time point via a capacity (alpha-wealth) recursion, together
  with the code reproducing all figures in the paper.
license: MIT
type: software
